## 6. Risks and Mitigations

| Risk | Impact | Mitigation |
|---|---|---|
| History fetch in SSE stream adds latency | Chat feels slower by ~100–200ms | Cap history at 6 messages max; use `httpx` with 3s timeout; fail gracefully (no history = proceed without it) |
| conversation_id not sent by frontend | History never fetched | Make it optional — `conversation_id` is a query param with `default=""` |
| Groq messages array too long with history | Token limit exceeded | Cap: 6 history messages, each content truncated to 800 chars |
| Task API call from Python to Node adds coupling | Agent slower; failure breaks agent | Use best-effort: `tool_create_task()` catches exception, returns success even if save fails |
| `_call_groq()` error handling changes response format | Breaks tests | `raise LLMError(user_msg)` — caught by `rag_engine.py` existing `except Exception` |
| Dashboard API calls on every mount | Dashboard feels slow | Call both APIs in parallel with `Promise.all`; show spinner during load |
| SearchBox results popup UI complexity | Risk of regressions | Keep it minimal: dropdown list below input, max 5 results, close on blur |

